  "question": {
    "text": "Which one of the following <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;aqueous solutions will exhibit the largest freezing point depression?"
